:: Inklink [config]
(((
`define`'s second test (docs/define.md): Ex 9's spellbook written with
steps 2 and 3, built on an archetype as the revised recommendation said,
so one word covers single spells and combos. Only the spellbook is here;
the rest of `ex9-saltmarrow.twee` stands as it is.

What it changes, against the general words:

| | General words | `define` |
|---|---|---|
| Each spell's numbers | twice: in the description, and in the effect | once, as a field; the description is built from the fields |
| Range | a `~ at` filter, and the word "touch" in the description | a field from a closed set, and still the `~ at` filter |
| The book's Links | nineteen, written out, each with its label | none: the platform offers each spell by its verb, "Cast kindle at the stop-planks" |
| Grouping | the tag `spell` | `"defined_as": "spell"` in the IR |

The four rows are what Ex 9 needs and Ex 2 did not: many spells with
numbers, a Linker who reads the book, and spells offered everywhere.
)))

:: spell [define]
(((
A spell is an act or a combo (read from its form: a combo lists its
parts), with the tag `spell`. Its description is built from its fields,
so a number is written once. The effects below `--` read the same fields,
so a spell's effect clauses can say `self.power` and `self.lasts`.
)))
verb: cast
field range: self, touch, here, next, mine ~ default self
field power: number ~ default 0
field lasts: number ~ default 0
field about: text
--
spell
~ "{self.about} Range: {self.range}.{if self.power > 0 then " Power {self.power}." else ""}{if self.lasts > 0 then " Lasts {self.lasts} turns." else ""}"
~ offered everywhere

:: apprentice [character]
--
spell kindle: cost 1 ~ range touch ~ learned from primer
~ about "A flame at your fingertip, for a wick or dry wood."
~ at item here where: it.catches and not it.lit
~ then set target.lit: yes
spell glimmer: cost 1 ~ lasts 8 ~ learned from primer
~ about "A cold light about you, with no heat in it."
~ then set me.glimmering: yes ~ for self.lasts turns
spell quench: cost 2 ~ range here ~ power 2 ~ learned from primer
~ about "Puts fire down: a blaze to a smoulder, a smoulder to nothing."
~ when here.heat > 0
~ then lower here.heat self.power
spell gust: cost 1 ~ range next ~ learned from primer
~ about "One breath of wind, sent into the next place. Clears bad air; snuffs candles; feeds fires."
~ at place where: it.next_to(here)
~ then set gas: 0 when target == drift
~ then set gleaner.candle_lit: no when gleaner.in(target)
~ then raise target.heat 1 when target.heat > 0
spell hush: cost 2 ~ lasts 4 ~ learned from carving_hush
~ about "Your steps make no sound."
~ then set me.hushed: yes ~ for self.lasts turns
spell ward: cost 2 ~ lasts 3 ~ learned from carving_ward
~ about "A skin of salt that takes one blow."
~ then cover me ~ for self.lasts turns
spell tongue: cost 2 ~ lasts 6 ~ learned from carving_tongue
~ about "Speech with things that were made, not born."
~ then set me.tongued: yes ~ for self.lasts turns
spell knit: cost 2 ~ range touch ~ learned from notes_mending
~ about "Mends a small break."
~ at item here where: it.broken
~ then set target.broken: no
spell shore: cost 3 ~ range touch ~ power 3 ~ learned from notes_mending
~ about "Timber that has burnt holds a while longer: a crossing for each point of power."
~ when here.like(shaft) and here.burnt
~ then raise here.crossings self.power
spell lighten: cost 3 ~ range touch ~ lasts 6 ~ learned from notes_weight
~ about "One thing, or one person, weighs nothing."
~ at person here where: it != me
~ then set target.lightened: yes ~ for self.lasts turns
spell draw: cost 2 ~ range here ~ power 2 ~ learned from boilers_charm
~ about "Calls water out of rock, or out of a flooded way."
~ then set flask.water: brine when flask.water == empty
~ then lower stair_water self.power when here in [brine_pans, sump]
spell sweeten: cost 2 ~ range touch ~ learned from boilers_charm
~ about "Takes the salt out of water."
~ when flask.water == brine
~ then set flask.water: fresh
spell clear: cost 4 ~ range touch ~ power 2 ~ learned from chalk_charm
~ about "Shifts a fall of stone, a load for each point of power."
~ when here == marrow and rubble > 0
~ then lower rubble self.power
spell dowse: cost 1 ~ range mine ~ learned from dowsing
~ about "Tells you which way the air goes out."

spell freshet: draw, sweeten ~ range here ~ power 1 ~ learned from notes_greater
~ about "Fresh water, all at once, at one thing. A ward of salt for each point of power."
~ at npc here where: it.salted
~ then lower target.salt self.power
spell firebrand: kindle, gust ~ range next ~ learned from notes_greater
~ about "A flame thrown into the next place."
~ at place where: it.next_to(here) and it.timbered and it.heat == 0 and not it.burnt
~ then set target.heat: 1
spell shroud: glimmer, hush ~ lasts 4 ~ learned from notes_greater
~ about "No warmth, no sound, from you or what you carry."
~ then set me.shrouded: yes ~ for self.lasts turns
spell bridge: knit, shore ~ range next ~ learned from notes_greater
~ about "A fallen shaft stands once more, for one crossing."
~ at place where: it.next_to(here) and it.like(shaft) and it.fallen
~ then set target.fallen: no
~ then set target.crossings: 1
spell updraught: gust, lighten ~ learned from notes_greater
~ about "You ride the air up the cage shaft, with no cage."
~ when here == incline
